<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>头痛 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A4%B4%E7%97%9B/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 10:25:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A4%B4%E7%97%9B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>吸治法：论胞上升 论头痛 论肠下 论疮毒初起</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-32-xizhifa/</link><pubDate>Sun, 24 May 2026 10:23:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-32-xizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“吸治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;以药物外敷、纳鼻、吸毒等“吸”法治疗胎衣不下、肠脱、头痛、疮毒初起&lt;/strong&gt;等症。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病势急迫或不耐汤药者，可取药物敷贴于特定部位（足心、顶心、鼻孔），利用药力吸引或引邪外出，使病速愈&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>完治法：论头痛 论脑痛 论两臂肩膀痛 论两足痛 腰下痛</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-7-wanzhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 15:10:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-7-wanzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“完治法”部分，论述&lt;strong&gt;头痛、脑痛、两臂肩膀痛、两足痛及腰以下痛&lt;/strong&gt;的治法。核心思想是“&lt;strong&gt;囫囵而治&lt;/strong&gt;”，即不施刀针局部破解，而以&lt;strong&gt;黄酒为引&lt;/strong&gt;，配合大剂风药或补益之品，使药力直达病所，一醉而愈。</description></item><item><title>针灸治症：梅花针、头部与脑瘤治症</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu-6-1/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Jul 2025 08:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/zhenjiu-6-1/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%92%88%E7%81%B8%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/">针灸笔记</category><description>本文总结了针灸在梅花针应用、头痛分类治疗及脑瘤诊断与治疗中的关键点，强调辨经取穴、穴位诊断与导引法的重要性，并指出梅花针适用于皮肤病和麻痹症等浅表病症。</description></item></channel></rss>